  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thierryc/Glyphs-mcp/zipball/v2.0.0-beta.11",
  "body": "Glyphs MCP Desktop 2.0.0 Beta 11 / build 53 is a maintenance prerelease for Glyphs 4 on macOS 14 or later, with universal Apple silicon and Intel binaries.\n\nThis release advances the beta identity and installer build and updates current source, packaging and release documentation. Native font behavior is unchanged from Beta 10. It retains new-font creation through `create_document`, separate saving through `save_document`, thirteen MCP tools, eleven managed skills, improved checkpoint history and the bundled Beztrace 0.1.1-dev.4 development engine.\n\nDownload the versioned DMG below. The ZIP and signed appcast support desktop updates; component migration remains a separate installation step. Glyphs 3 remains on its separate pinned v1.11.0 release. This beta does not replace Stable Latest.\n\nQualification and limits: [Beta 11 qualification](https://github.com/thierryc/Glyphs-mcp/blob/lit/v2-beta/BETA11-VALIDATION.md). Physical Intel/minimum-macOS, the exact signed older-to-Beta-11 app update/component-migration trial, and narrow-window/dark-mode acceptance remain unperformed. Both bundled runtime architectures are checked on Apple silicon, including x86_64 through Rosetta. Carried-forward group-pair native UI Undo and exact-pair card visual limits remain disclosed. The independent Beztrace Glyphs plugin remains separate; its development engine's bundling/signing does not establish tracing quality or plugin acceptance.\n"
